Comment: The main orig archive is exported from driver commit
 2cbd7b9ddf2318d58044dcbd57dc187dfca55034.
 The firmware orig component contains only Bin/ from TC9564_Firmware
 commit f9b0e1bc0f7c3dfc74ad1a46a87efa56885b9288 (V6.0.0).
 The package redistributes the published binary, as the Yocto recipe does.

